T Test joints: post frame, axle through hubs, side clip, spacer, flexi, 3D pair
! frame in the xz plane
C A W8 0,0,0 y x
C B W8 2,0,0 y x
C At W8 0,0,2 y x
C Bt W8 2,0,2 y x
R A B
R A At
R B Bt
R At Bt
! axle along y through the hubs of A and B (free ends), spacer, clip on the bottom rod
R 0,-1,0 0,1,0 blue
P 0,0.5,0 blue
S K W8 1,0,0 z          # clip on rod A-B at its midpoint, arm up (+z): hub sits 13.75 mm below the rod
C K2 W8 K@0,0,-2 x z     # two units below the clip hub, plane yz, slot 0 along z
R K K2
R Bt K2 flexi-grey      # flexi from the post top down to K2: leaves Bt on a free diagonal socket and bows
! 3D pair
C P1 B7 4,0,0 z x
C P2 B7 4,0,0 x y
